    "original_author_id": 0,
    "title": "enhance: run JavaScript actions from a host Node with container.node_dir",
    "body": "Docker jobs fail on images without node, while GitHub supplies its own. `container.node_dir` mounts a Node install from the Docker daemon's host read-only at `/__e/node` for JavaScript actions and `hashFiles`. It stays off `PATH`, so steps and `actions/setup-node` see only what the job installs. The build must match the job images' architecture and libc.\n\nFixes: https://gitea.com/orbit/orbit/issues/1393\nFixes: https://gitea.com/orbit/orbit/issues/538\n",
